    "status": "Implementation default, not an owner decision; adopt or replace it in the protocol freeze.",
    "unit": "Task. Arms are paired within a task; a run is one observation however many ideas it contains.",
    "primary_attempt": "The last attempt in each slot gives the outcome (a permitted retry replaces an infrastructure failure); every attempt counts for resources.",
    "quality": "Per reviewer: mean of the five rubric dimensions when all five are present. Per slot: mean over reviewers with complete ratings. Missing ratings are never imputed.",
    "implementation": "Share of executed frozen cases (held-out included) passed by the last attempt; accepted when submitted and every case passed.",
    "discovery": "Per theme: mean over repeats for each method, then open-ended minus structured. Repeats are not independent observations.",
