      "resamples": 2000,
      "interval": 0.95
    },
    "agreement": "Quadratic-weighted kappa per dimension for exactly two reviewers, plus every disagreement of two points or more.",
    "cost": "Cost per accepted outcome counts every attempt (failures and retries). Undefined when nothing was accepted; a lower bound when billing is unknown or in flight.",
    "exploratory": "Per-protocol completion (ran slots only) is exploratory and reported apart from the assigned-condition tables."
  },
